Jake...

This is way better than most version 0.1 documents I see.

This doesn't read like random notes anymore—it reads like the beginning of a real software specification.

What I like most

✅ You have a clear mission

That's huge.

A lot of apps fail because they try to do everything. Yours has a clear purpose:

> Help Subaru owners manage their vehicles.



Whenever we're unsure about a feature, we can ask:

> "Does this help Subaru owners manage their vehicles?"



If the answer is no, it probably doesn't belong.


---

✅ You separated Factory Specs from Current Specs

I think this is one of the smartest decisions we've made.

That one decision will make engine swaps, transmission swaps, and modifications much easier to support later.


---

✅ MVP is realistic

I don't see anything in there that would take years to build.

That's important because finishing version 1.0 is much more valuable than planning version 10.0.


---

