---

🛢 Fluids

Instead of just having a Fluids screen, I'd make a FluidSpec model.

FluidSpec
├── Category
├── Capacity
├── Factory Fluid
├── Current Fluid
├── Change Interval
├── Last Changed
└── Notes

Then we can reuse it for:

Engine oil

Transmission

Front differential

Rear differential

Coolant

Brake fluid

Power steering



